config discovery
├── when using default check severities
│   └── it warns for todo markers
├── when finding the nearest config
│   ├── it finds a config beside the tree file
│   ├── it walks up to an ancestor within the root
│   ├── it stops at the invocation root
│   └── it returns none without any config
└── when resolving the governing root
    ├── it uses the nearest config for a tree file
    └── it falls back to the invocation root
